  "title": "Light Show in the Rain",
  "date": "2026-09-17T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Light Show in the Rain\n\nAnother year to see the light show in Kadriorg. Last time was a sunny day. But this time, all four days are rainy. Since it might be the last time, I still went to.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt was not as exciting as last year. I thought it was because of the rain. There were less people, and larger area. So it was not too crowded.",
